{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日本名古屋下暴雨，地鐵暫停運行。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">名古屋市面多處變成澤國。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20261LgnWydJP31788872205.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">受到秋季鋒面影響，日本中部歧阜縣以及名古屋所在的愛知縣，周二下午下暴雨，氣象廳向流經兩縣的莊內川發布最高級別的第五級河水氾濫警報。名古屋錄得一小時降雨量突破一百毫米，打破當地紀錄。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">大量雨水流入地下停車場和地鐵站。有地鐵站月台猶如瀑布，工作人員忙於清理。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026u2XhCcW6eJ1788872267.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026kyYK6I44HN1788872288.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">名古屋市營地鐵全線暫停運行。東海道山陽新幹線一度暫停運行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T14:28:48.324790+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}